  "scope": "Integer real-amplitude algebra with specified controlled-X and local Z. Equal pairs of reduced states and computational-basis masses do not determine the next control density. A four-integer summary retaining the relevant joint cross contribution gives exact control responses for all finite words of the two supplied operations, using SystemsOrganization.evolve_semiconjugacy. Normalized physical interpretation is supplied. No quantum-foundation, causal-nonseparability, universal nonlocality, empirical, ethical or zero-axiom claim."
